WEBVTT

00:02.130 --> 00:03.220
I'm sorry.

00:04.200 --> 00:07.170
Forgive me, Takuma.

00:07.940 --> 00:09.430
As if I could forgive you!

00:10.270 --> 00:12.670
Hey, can you hear me, Tamaki?

00:13.340 --> 00:14.400
Takuma?

00:14.740 --> 00:17.680
Even though the Tamayori princess' order is absolute,

00:17.680 --> 00:20.170
even though you told me to leave, I came.

00:20.680 --> 00:22.010
Say something.

00:23.450 --> 00:25.440
You mustn't, Takuma.

00:25.850 --> 00:27.290
You finally spoke.

00:31.390 --> 00:34.990
Say it. Tell me what you want me to do.

00:39.200 --> 00:40.360
Help me.

00:41.500 --> 00:43.030
Help me, Takuma!

00:45.170 --> 00:46.440
Stand aside!

02:30.280 --> 02:31.970
It's impossible, Takuma!

02:32.280 --> 02:35.920
This door can only be opened by the blood of the Tamayori.

02:32.410 --> 02:36.420
Their Resolution

02:35.920 --> 02:37.150
Shut up and watch!

02:37.820 --> 02:39.750
I'll break it all down.

03:02.610 --> 03:04.100
I came to see you,

03:05.310 --> 03:06.470
Tamaki.

03:14.360 --> 03:16.790
I've been kicked out of the
Shugogo house anyway.

03:17.890 --> 03:19.920
I'll protect you, Tamaki.

03:20.360 --> 03:23.820
From now on, I'll be your own guardian.

03:27.640 --> 03:28.830
Takuma.

03:29.470 --> 03:31.000
You're so warm.

03:33.370 --> 03:35.170
You know, Takuma.

03:37.510 --> 03:40.970
There's something I wanted to tell you.

03:41.880 --> 03:46.620
A dream that I've had ever since
I came here, to Kifu village.

03:47.660 --> 03:52.390
I heard a sad voice calling out to me over and over again.

03:52.860 --> 03:56.320
And I finally realized the truth.

04:01.240 --> 04:02.830
Wait, Mahiro!

04:07.780 --> 04:10.470
Explain. What's the sacrifice?

04:11.080 --> 04:13.310
What fate are you talking about?

04:17.790 --> 04:21.720
It's a thousand year old story about the Atori house.

04:23.190 --> 04:26.420
My ancient ancestor was called Kusonomikoto.

04:27.060 --> 04:29.330
When crisis befell the world,

04:29.760 --> 04:32.400
he relied on the Tamayori princess' and Onikirimaru's strength

04:32.400 --> 04:34.460
and fought with his comrades.

04:35.140 --> 04:39.270
Everyone fought with all they had, and lost their lives.

04:39.710 --> 04:42.370
My ancestor alone survived.

04:43.040 --> 04:44.600
He got scared and ran.

04:46.550 --> 04:50.540
That's why the one with Atori blood must be sacrificed this time.

04:52.090 --> 04:55.220
In order to atone for past sins.

04:57.230 --> 05:00.750
Even though I promised Tamaki...

05:01.660 --> 05:03.230
<i>It's all right.</i>

05:03.230 --> 05:06.400
<i>If I, Mahiro Atori, say I'll do something about it,</i>

05:06.400 --> 05:07.530
<i>I'll do something about it.</i>

05:08.740 --> 05:10.860
But now it's too late.

05:12.840 --> 05:14.840
I ran away again.

05:14.840 --> 05:17.080
I put aside my determination.

05:17.080 --> 05:21.610
That's why Tamaki, the Tamayori princess, will be sacrificed.

05:22.280 --> 05:26.190
We know nothing about each other.

05:26.190 --> 05:28.960
But whether we know or not,

05:28.960 --> 05:32.290
our bonds as guardians are true.

05:33.160 --> 05:35.330
What we must do

05:35.330 --> 05:39.730
is protect the Tamayori princess and the seal, together.

05:40.340 --> 05:43.330
This isn't about having one person become a sacrifice, is it?

05:44.140 --> 05:46.870
I have been supported by the Shugogo house.

05:46.870 --> 05:50.000
And all of us together are the Shugogo house.

05:50.810 --> 05:52.610
Don't forget it.

05:54.680 --> 05:57.810
I'm the reincarnation of the Underworld god?

05:59.720 --> 06:00.890
That's right.

06:00.890 --> 06:03.860
You promised to protect me forever.

06:04.660 --> 06:07.320
In my previous life,
I was the first guardian.

06:09.360 --> 06:13.460
Thank you. I feel a little better.

06:14.700 --> 06:16.000
The only...

06:17.370 --> 06:20.640
The only thing left is to prevent this power from going wild.

06:23.010 --> 06:24.030
Hey, Tamaki.

06:25.350 --> 06:26.980
We're going to run away for a bit.

06:26.980 --> 06:28.310
But...

06:29.050 --> 06:32.420
You're going to die for the sake of protecting the Onikirimaru seal?

06:32.420 --> 06:34.180
That's too unreasonable.

06:35.890 --> 06:37.430
First we run away.

06:37.430 --> 06:40.190
Then we think of a way to save the world.

06:42.360 --> 06:44.700
Where are we going now?

06:45.530 --> 06:47.200
If I knew, I'd tell you.

06:47.200 --> 06:49.500
So we have no plan.

07:01.550 --> 07:03.750
I'm disappointed, Tamaki.

07:03.750 --> 07:06.720
To think that your resolve was so shallow.

07:07.220 --> 07:08.450
Grandma...

07:09.860 --> 07:11.630
I thought you'd come,

07:11.630 --> 07:12.720
Onizaki.

07:13.630 --> 07:15.930
You really are annoying.

07:20.700 --> 07:22.070
Takuma?

07:23.600 --> 07:26.160
What have you done?

07:26.910 --> 07:29.310
I met you yesterday, didn't I?

07:29.310 --> 07:32.180
I put a mushi in you then.

07:32.710 --> 07:35.950
A very hungry mushi that loves spiritual power.

07:36.750 --> 07:38.850
<i>Can you stand? Let me help you.</i>

07:43.420 --> 07:45.890
You can still stand?

07:46.630 --> 07:49.160
It was my best poison.

07:49.160 --> 07:52.260
People and demons really are quite different.

08:09.520 --> 08:10.490
Takuma!

08:44.750 --> 08:45.780
Takuma...

08:46.450 --> 08:47.950
The Onikirimaru...

08:48.460 --> 08:49.620
You can't!

08:49.620 --> 08:52.460
If you hold the Onikirimaru, you'll be poisoned.

08:53.290 --> 08:54.130
I'm fine.

08:54.800 --> 08:57.420
This is nothing.

08:58.530 --> 09:00.060
Takuma Onizaki.

09:00.700 --> 09:02.670
Do you understand what you're doing?

09:02.670 --> 09:05.140
You can't be in your right mind.

09:05.540 --> 09:07.940
You want to make the
Bureau of Medicine... No,

09:08.480 --> 09:11.970
the country, even the whole world, your enemy?

09:22.720 --> 09:23.950
I swear...

09:25.030 --> 09:27.050
I won't let you lay a single finger on Tamaki.

09:29.100 --> 09:34.230
If my fate is to die with her, then I'll crush my fate.

09:35.700 --> 09:37.170
Let's go, Tamaki.

09:42.880 --> 09:43.710
Takuma,

09:44.080 --> 09:47.540
I'm sorry. I'll never tell you not to come to me again.

10:03.400 --> 10:04.470
Hey...

10:04.470 --> 10:07.400
Shouldn't we be able to see the bus stop by now?

10:08.070 --> 10:10.330
Yeah. Something's strange.

10:15.610 --> 10:16.580
This way!

10:21.680 --> 10:22.950
You!

10:23.950 --> 10:26.790
Now, now. You're late.

10:28.460 --> 10:30.190
What were you doing?

10:31.430 --> 10:33.390
Is this your spell? Move!

10:34.230 --> 10:36.250
Even if you tell me that...

10:41.600 --> 10:45.300
You two can't get away.

10:45.940 --> 10:48.770
Now, let's go back to the shrine.

10:56.280 --> 10:57.620
It's no use.

10:58.020 --> 11:01.820
Don't you realize that the more you use the Onikirimaru's power,

11:01.820 --> 11:04.310
the more disadvantaged you'll be?

11:07.290 --> 11:08.790
Takuma, this way.

11:11.000 --> 11:11.830
Tamaki!

11:12.830 --> 11:14.030
Well, well.

11:14.870 --> 11:16.130
Let's go through the forest.

11:16.470 --> 11:17.340
You...

11:17.810 --> 11:19.140
I'll be all right.

11:19.740 --> 11:21.640
If I'm with you, I can do my best.

11:24.010 --> 11:25.340
It's no use.

11:25.810 --> 11:27.180
Come on back.

11:39.230 --> 11:40.390
Weird...

11:40.390 --> 11:41.200
Huh?

11:41.200 --> 11:43.390
We've been going in circles.

11:45.030 --> 11:46.760
Is it his doing again?

11:53.210 --> 11:55.180
Those who interrupt our slumber...

11:55.180 --> 11:57.010
Devour! Devour!

11:57.010 --> 11:58.040
Stay back!

12:13.430 --> 12:14.730
These gods...

12:14.730 --> 12:16.430
No matter how many times
I cut them down...

12:16.430 --> 12:17.400
Why?

12:17.900 --> 12:20.130
Even though they know they can't win...

12:20.430 --> 12:22.060
Is it the Onikirimaru's influence?

12:24.540 --> 12:27.170
Devour! Devour!

12:27.170 --> 12:29.410
Our prey...

12:27.410 --> 12:30.380
<i>Is Grandma controlling them, too?</i>

12:31.010 --> 12:32.500
I'll kill you all together...

12:35.720 --> 12:37.220
You mustn't, Takuma!

12:37.220 --> 12:40.090
If you use any more of the
Onikirimaru's power...

12:40.450 --> 12:41.920
I don't care.

12:42.560 --> 12:45.290
If I don't use it, we won't be able to get through.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.190
No!

12:50.360 --> 12:53.430
Want to eat! Want to eat!

12:55.440 --> 12:57.230
Damn it!

12:58.940 --> 13:02.710
I'll kill you. I'll kill you all!

13:02.710 --> 13:03.700
Takuma!

13:04.950 --> 13:06.040
This way.

13:10.080 --> 13:11.150
This isn't good.

13:11.150 --> 13:14.650
If I let Takuma use any more of the Onikirimaru's power...

13:18.860 --> 13:20.290
Are you okay, Tamaki?

13:21.000 --> 13:22.000
Yeah.

13:22.000 --> 13:26.990
But why put up barriers in such a dense formation?

13:28.740 --> 13:31.970
To gather the gods and trap us...

13:32.640 --> 13:34.870
Grandma really does intend to...

13:40.110 --> 13:41.240
Tamaki!

13:41.450 --> 13:45.690
I cannot control the gods, but I might be able

13:45.690 --> 13:47.310
to do something about this barrier.

13:47.790 --> 13:48.690
What?

13:48.690 --> 13:52.290
I'll make a hole in the barrier and once we get outside,

13:52.290 --> 13:53.890
I'll close the hole.

13:54.960 --> 13:55.930
Got it.

13:56.700 --> 13:58.330
I'll hold them off.

13:58.870 --> 13:59.600
In the meantime...

14:05.510 --> 14:06.940
Takuma...

14:06.940 --> 14:07.930
With Tamaki?

14:08.580 --> 14:10.410
And the Onikirimaru.

14:12.550 --> 14:16.220
There were three guardians on duty. What were you doing?

14:16.220 --> 14:18.920
In order to seal the Onikirimaru,

14:18.920 --> 14:21.150
Tamaki's presence is indispensable.

14:21.560 --> 14:24.750
It'll be trouble if they manage to break through the barrier.

14:25.160 --> 14:26.860
Bring them back immediately.

14:27.900 --> 14:29.660
Lady Baba, wait a second.

14:29.660 --> 14:33.330
Tamaki hasn't agreed to be the sacrifice.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.970
Isn't that why she ran away with Takuma?

14:36.500 --> 14:41.030
You're all acting like you want the two of them to get away.

14:42.540 --> 14:44.010
Now that it has come to this,

14:44.810 --> 14:48.580
we don't have time to be discussing what Tamaki wants.

14:49.420 --> 14:50.850
It looks like they're trying to

14:50.850 --> 14:53.150
make it through the woods and escape the village.

14:53.890 --> 14:56.690
Don't they know it's useless?

14:57.390 --> 14:58.720
The woods...

14:59.160 --> 15:01.630
I don't mind as long as they're alive.

15:02.360 --> 15:04.660
In any case, bring them back.

15:07.070 --> 15:08.400
Make it fast.

16:18.970 --> 16:20.600
I want power.

16:21.240 --> 16:22.970
If I had power...

16:33.820 --> 16:37.620
The Artifact has escaped the barrier with the demon.

16:37.620 --> 16:39.220
It appears that Sibyl is with him.

16:39.760 --> 16:40.750
Is that right?

16:44.930 --> 16:49.460
Eins, you go first and steal it.

16:50.200 --> 16:53.300
I'll go report to Aria.

16:54.480 --> 16:55.570
Will you go?

17:06.250 --> 17:09.990
The Artifact's power hasn't been released yet.

17:10.560 --> 17:13.120
It looks as though Sibyl is the key after all.

17:13.830 --> 17:15.760
I can't wait.

17:19.670 --> 17:20.760
Takuma!

17:31.410 --> 17:32.880
Good.

17:32.880 --> 17:35.820
Now you don't have to use the Onikirimaru anymore.

17:36.980 --> 17:38.350
Thank you, Tamaki.

17:40.520 --> 17:41.920
Takuma?

17:41.920 --> 17:47.520
S-Stop it. Stop trying to get inside me.

17:48.430 --> 17:49.520
Takuma!

17:52.830 --> 17:55.700
Why? At a time like this...

17:56.340 --> 17:58.830
Demon, you're not dead?

18:01.710 --> 18:04.080
Are you trying to protect Sibyl

18:04.680 --> 18:06.510
by using the demon's strength?

18:07.410 --> 18:11.250
You fear the power, yet you use the power,

18:11.250 --> 18:13.080
and are spoiled by the power.

18:14.120 --> 18:15.990
You contradict yourself.

18:18.130 --> 18:20.060
Stay away from Tamaki.

18:20.460 --> 18:23.590
You are about to be swallowed by power,

18:24.030 --> 18:25.930
because you refute power.

18:26.230 --> 18:27.470
Silence.

18:27.470 --> 18:29.330
I sense a quickening.

18:29.800 --> 18:32.600
You will soon no longer be human.

18:33.940 --> 18:39.440
How does it feel to possess superhuman power?

18:43.750 --> 18:45.850
How does it feel to break through what it means to be human,

18:45.850 --> 18:49.050
and become a monster of godlike power?

18:49.920 --> 18:51.630
Takuma is human.

18:51.630 --> 18:53.060
He's precious to me,

18:53.730 --> 18:55.560
kind and strong...

18:55.560 --> 18:57.050
He's more important to me than anyone.

18:57.630 --> 19:01.400
Move, Sibyl. I have no interest in you.

19:02.140 --> 19:04.700
If you don't move, you'll die here.

19:08.310 --> 19:09.040
Then...

19:09.480 --> 19:10.410
Stop it!

19:18.220 --> 19:20.620
Kutani... Ryo?

19:22.690 --> 19:24.280
I couldn't stand back and watch.

19:24.760 --> 19:26.730
And you call yourself a guardian?

19:28.400 --> 19:31.170
Hey, from what I've been hearing,

19:31.170 --> 19:33.200
you've been raving about humans and monsters.

19:33.200 --> 19:34.800
There's no point in you asking.

19:34.800 --> 19:36.430
He'll decide for himself.

19:36.700 --> 19:38.670
Stop meddling.

19:38.670 --> 19:39.940
Meddling?

19:40.710 --> 19:43.440
Up until now, I've sought power.

19:43.810 --> 19:47.010
And now, you've surpassed humanity.

19:47.010 --> 19:51.320
I sense that you've obtained power that rivals demons and gods.

19:51.890 --> 19:55.620
I want to test your power,

19:55.620 --> 20:02.290
and whether my power can overturn god and fate.

20:04.000 --> 20:05.660
I'll let you go.

20:06.230 --> 20:08.600
Demon, answer me.

20:09.500 --> 20:12.670
For what purpose is your strength?

20:21.520 --> 20:23.110
Are you all right, Takuma?

20:23.880 --> 20:25.650
Is this any time to relax?

20:27.020 --> 20:30.220
Your fellow guardians will be after you any moment now.

20:31.020 --> 20:32.720
Hurry and escape from the village.

20:33.390 --> 20:34.590
Why?

20:36.000 --> 20:38.730
As a parting gift, I'll tell you this.

20:39.900 --> 20:42.560
My real name is Inukai.

20:44.870 --> 20:50.080
Whether my parents were of the Shugogo house or not,

20:50.080 --> 20:52.340
I was raised apart from any of that.

20:53.050 --> 20:56.680
I don't know what fate caused us to meet again, though.

20:57.280 --> 20:59.390
Then, Shinji is...

20:59.390 --> 21:01.150
He's not from the Inukai house.

21:01.890 --> 21:03.590
He was born into the Kotokura house,

21:03.590 --> 21:07.060
and is Mitsuru Kotokura's brother, her twin.

21:07.060 --> 21:08.360
Twin?

21:08.630 --> 21:10.860
That... That can't be...

21:11.430 --> 21:14.400
We're all cursed by the
Tamayori princess.

21:14.870 --> 21:16.060
This entire village is.

21:21.640 --> 21:22.970
You, too.

21:24.410 --> 21:28.350
You're being played with by the Onikirimaru.

21:29.320 --> 21:31.790
It's all the Tamayori princess' doing.

21:34.390 --> 21:38.120
Shut up. I'm here of my own will.

21:38.630 --> 21:40.090
It has nothing to do with you!

21:41.900 --> 21:45.090
Then do something about it. If you can.

21:45.430 --> 21:46.490
I will.

21:48.400 --> 21:50.840
I'll definitely do something.

21:50.840 --> 21:52.140
I won't let anyone...

21:52.140 --> 21:54.670
I won't let a single person suffer misfortune.

23:34.510 --> 23:36.070
When I think back now,

23:36.780 --> 23:38.710
when I first laid eyes on you,

23:39.850 --> 23:42.150
I may have already fallen in love.

23:49.390 --> 23:53.190
If I said I love you, would it trouble you?

23:54.730 --> 24:00.960
Next Time: The Eternal Promise
